{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a husk of a once-diligent scholar finds a legendary mask in the mountaintops of Wisdom, a long foreseen prophecy of inevitable life and inevitable death begins to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>False Hero is a fast-paced soulslike adventure with a unique combat system. Copy the attacks of your foes and chain them together into deadly combos to put maximum pressure on your opponents</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a realm where the gods of life reign, Death starts to spread. The prophecy foretold that you would slay this eldritch evil, but it is your decision to fight for the gods or to become an apostle of Death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Copy your enemies' attacks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mask grants you the ability to study your enemies' style of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn a unique attack from each enemy you kill, and grow your arsenal of deadly combat arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/01b21f0a2c5214b7fdd5a51bbe311bf7.poster.avif?t=1771893956\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/01b21f0a2c5214b7fdd5a51bbe311bf7.webm?t=1771893956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/01b21f0a2c5214b7fdd5a51bbe311bf7.mp4?t=1771893956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-paced combat </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform a quick dash to evade enemy attacks, chain together your learned combat arts into unique combos and utilize the power of gods to put maximum pressure on your opponents.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/b0eca60874b3f9ffebff2c114281e0e5.poster.avif?t=1771893956\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/b0eca60874b3f9ffebff2c114281e0e5.webm?t=1771893956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/b0eca60874b3f9ffebff2c114281e0e5.mp4?t=1771893956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging boss fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The many boss fights will truly put your combat skills to the test. From giant arachnoid beasts to fast angelic beings, every single boss is designed with their unique move set to be challenging but fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/a40e5bf9df2e9350d9cbf66728bcf458.poster.avif?t=1771893956\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/a40e5bf9df2e9350d9cbf66728bcf458.webm?t=1771893956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From lush swamps to ancient cities, each region features its own unique enemies and puzzles. Explore the twisting and interconnected lands of the gods and uncover the truth behind the spreading of Death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/6f8ca1da88631497fc737383c4d438b3.poster.avif?t=1771893956\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/6f8ca1da88631497fc737383c4d438b3.webm?t=1771893956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/6f8ca1da88631497fc737383c4d438b3.mp4?t=1771893956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy your enemies' attacks and weave their moves into your own combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique and challenging boss monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore large, interconnected levels and uncover their secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire the god's powers to solve puzzles and gain an edge in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide the fate of this world: rescue the gods of Life or become an apostle of Death</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All lands have fallen to Death and been corrupted beyond repair. Let them live on or destroy them once and for all.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2538870?t=1771893956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/6c0c3886fef586253198cb08db7b56b14946a2fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771893956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/30f10d19f8ca491d213879525845f5e25502845d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771893956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/30f10d19f8ca491d213879525845f5e25502845d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771893956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_desc