o put maximum pressure on your opponents.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/b0eca60874b3f9ffebff2c114281e0e5.poster.avif?t=1771893956\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/b0eca60874b3f9ffebff2c114281e0e5.webm?t=1771893956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/b0eca60874b3f9ffebff2c114281e0e5.mp4?t=1771893956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging boss fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The many boss fights will truly put your combat skills to the test. From giant arachnoid beasts to fast angelic beings, every single boss is designed with their unique move set to be challenging but fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/a40e5bf9df2e9350d9cbf66728bcf458.poster.avif?t=1771893956\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/a40e5bf9df2e9350d9cbf66728bcf458.webm?t=1771893956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From lush swamps to ancient cities, each region features its own unique enemies and puzzles. Explore the twisting and interconnected lands of the gods and uncover the truth behind the spreading of Death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/6f8ca1da88631497fc737383c4d438b3.poster.avif?t=1771893956\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/6f8ca1da88631497fc737383c4d438b3.webm?t=1771893956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/extras/6f8ca1da88631497fc737383c4d438b3.mp4?t=1771893956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy your enemies' attacks and weave their moves into your own combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique and challenging boss monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore large, interconnected levels and uncover their secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire the god's powers to solve puzzles and gain an edge in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide the fate of this world: rescue the gods of Life or become an apostle of Death</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All lands have fallen to Death and been corrupted beyond repair. Let them live on or destroy them once and for all.</strong></p>","developers":["Torchlight Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538870/64363a43486819ad56b27af5b2a59ee87a767825/header.jpg?t=1771893956","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steam